# Night Soil: "{1}, Exile two creature cards from a single graveyard: Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token." The
# cards are exiled as a cost (CR 601.2h by way of 602.2b), from any player's graveyard. On turn 5 Bot2's graveyard holds two
# creature cards (Grizzly Bears, Memnite) and an Entomb, Bot1's one creature card (Ornithopter): Bot1 pays the {1} with the
# one {G} it floats (the pool empty after it), may choose neither its own Ornithopter (a graveyard of one creature card can't
# give two) nor an Entomb (not a creature card), exiles Bot2's Bears and Memnite, and gets one 1/1 green Saproling.

